BT
/FB 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 726 Tm (Every JavaScript action a PDF file can have) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (Each action below writes one line into the log field, so you can watch the order of events.) Tj
/FB 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 672 Tm (Runs when the file is opened) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 654 Tm (document-level JavaScript  \(/Names /JavaScript\)  -  neither switch can turn this one off) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 638 Tm (OpenAction  \(/OpenAction\)  -  needs "enable Open Action JavaScript", shows an alert) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 622 Tm (PageOpen  \(page /AA /O\)  -  fires again for every page you scroll to) Tj
/FB 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 596 Tm (Runs later - all of these need "enable Catalog AA JavaScript") Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 578 Tm (WillPrint and DidPrint  \(/AA /WP and /DP\)  -  press Ctrl+P) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 562 Tm (WillSave and DidSave  \(/AA /WS and /DS\)  -  click the download button) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 546 Tm (WillClose  \(/AA /WC\)  -  in this file, but pdf.js drops it while closing the document) Tj
/FR 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 68 530 Tm (PageClose  \(page /AA /C\)  -  scroll away from a page) Tj
/FB 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 500 Tm (Click into the log field first, then press Ctrl+P.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 484 Tm (pdf.js only shows an alert when you interacted with the document during the last five seconds,) Tj
/FR 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 470 Tm (and printing itself does not count. Without that click, WillPrint writes to the log but stays silent.) Tj
ET
